OL,3,ANew Orleans port files $1m lawsuit over
OL,4,A'miracle on the Mississippi' tanker
OL,5,Acollision
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Port of New Orleans is suing the
OL,8,Fowners and managers of a tanker that
OL,9,Fcrashed into a cruise ship docked there
OL,10,Fon Friday.
OL,12,FThe port is claiming the tanker is at
OL,13,Ffault for the collision that saw more
OL,14,Fthan 100 passengers being rescued from
OL,15,Fthe Mississippi River and caused more
OL,16,Fthan $1m (#756,000) in damage,
OL,17,Faccording to court documents.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
