OL,3,ANew Orleans port files $1m lawsuit over
OL,4,A'miracle on the Mississippi' tanker
OL,5,Acollision
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe collision left 32 people from the
OL,8,Fstricken riverboat in hospital with
OL,9,Fnon-critical injuries, but no-one was
OL,10,Funaccounted for. Officials hailed it as
OL,11,Fa "miracle on the Mississippi".
OL,13,FThe exact cause of the crash remains
OL,14,Funder investigation, but US Coast Guard
OL,15,FCapt Melanie Burnham said: "There seems
OL,16,Fto be some type of a loss of steering."
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
